  "technique_limits": {
    "chord_span": 12,
    "melodic_leap": 17,
    "rapid_leap": 9
  },
  "technical_note": "The long-short swing is written explicitly as quarter plus eighth within the dotted-quarter pulse. Lower attacks fall at 0, 1.5 and 3 quarter beats in bars 1\u20134, then shift to .5, 2 and 3 in bars 5\u20138. Keep the released chords light; the middle should feel displaced without accelerating.",
